#. お金…つまり<CLT 3>“欲望”<CLT>って事か？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was money, wasn't it? <CLT 3>Greed<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. デストローイ！　また当てやがった！？
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Seek and destroy! Hell yeah, you got it again!"
msgstr ""

#. そう！　金だよ金！
#. セレスが山田や石丸を殺したのは金のせいなんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Goddamn straight it was money! Celeste killed Hifumi\n"
"and Taka for a little personal gain!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり“欲望”が、
#. ３番目の事件の動機になったんだよ！
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Her greed led to all kinds of death and destruction!"
msgstr ""

#. それが…どうしたんだよ…！
#. さっきから同じような質問ばっかりして…！
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What's the point of all this? Why are you making us go\n"
"through this case by case!?"
msgstr ""

#. ひゃははははは！！
#. 焦んなって、次が最後だからよ！
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Haahahaha! Don't worry, sweet cheeks! Just one more to\n"
"go!"
msgstr ""

#. ちっとイレギュラーだった４番目の大神の殺人。
#. あそこで、オレが提示した動機のテーマがわかるか！？
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Now, can you tell me the motive behind crazy-ass\n"
"Sakura's crazy-ass death?"
msgstr ""

#. 裏切り
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Betrayal"
msgstr ""

#. 恐喝
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Blackmail"
msgstr ""

#. そーだべ！　モノクマがオーガを恐喝したんだ！
#. 人を殺せってな！
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"That's it! Monokuma blackmailed Ogre to get her to\n"
"kill us!"
msgstr ""

#. …あのね、あれは恐喝って言わないの！
#. 取引っていうの！
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hey! What you call blackmail, I call doing business!"
msgstr ""

#. ほんとにキミって、うぷぷぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Seriously, you just don't get it. Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、大神さんはモノクマから
#. 誰かを殺すように言われてたみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no doubt that Monokuma tried to coerce Sakura\n"
"into killing one of us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女が自らを殺す事になったきっかけは、
#. そんな事じゃなかったはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's not what led to Sakura killing *herself*.\n"
"There was another reason...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 隠し事
msgctxt "0016 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Secrets"
msgstr ""

#. 何かを隠すという行為自体が動機になったと、
#. そう言いたいのか…？
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So you're saying the desire to hide her secret was the\n"
"motive...?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと、そうじゃなくて…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, well...not quite..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女はボク達に隠し事をしてた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's true that she kept a secret from us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、隠してた事自体が問題なんじゃなくて、
#. 隠してた内容が問題だったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But what's important right now isn't *that* she hid\n"
"something, it's *what* she hid...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ほらほら、思い出してごらんよ！
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Come on, you gotta remember!"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんが自殺した、
#. あの４番目の殺人をさ…！
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That fourth murder! Or suicide! Or whatever Sakura!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時…モノクマが大神さんのあの行為をばらした事が
#. きっかけとなったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The trigger was when Monokuma exposed what Sakura had\n"
"been doing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>４番目の殺人の時の…動機のテーマは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The motive in the case of Sakura's death was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>４番目の殺人の時の…動機のテーマは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The motive in the case of Sakura's death was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時、大神さんが、
#. 自らを殺す事になったきっかけは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was it that made Sakura decide to kill\n"
"herself...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが彼女の行為をバラした事だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It had to do with Monokuma exposing Sakura's secret...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、４番目の殺人の時、
#. ボクらに提示された動機のテーマって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So the theme of the motive in that fourth case was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“裏切り”<CLT>…って事だろ？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "In her case, it was <CLT 3>betrayal<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. えぇ、そうなんです…
#. あの時は…
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Precisely. You see..."
msgstr ""

#. 私が、大神さんの“裏切り”をバラしたせいで…
#. 事件が起きちゃったんですよね…
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Once I revealed Sakura's betrayal, that led to\n"
"everything that came afterwards..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、これで４問全問正解です…
#. 痛快ですね…
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Anyway, it looks like you answered all of my questions\n"
"correctly. How painfully delightful..."
msgstr ""

#. それがどうした？　今の質問にどんな意味がある？
msgctxt "0035 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But what's the point? What meaning is there in asking\n"
"those questions now?"
msgstr ""

#. 人間関係とか過去の思い出とか、
#. 欲望とか裏切りとか…
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Relationships, secrets, money, betrayal..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ、動機の定番でしょ？
#. 王道のど真ん中…まさにど定番って感じだよね！
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"These are all pretty standard motives, right? The most\n"
"normal of normal, totally middle of the road!"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、もちろん世界に存在する動機は、
#. この４つだけではないわ…
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But of course those aren't the only motives that exist\n"
"in this world..."
msgstr ""

#. 人間が人間を殺す動機は、
#. 世界中のありとあらゆる所に無数に存在する。
msgctxt "0039 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"In fact, there are as many reasons to kill as there\n"
"are people on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. それは人々をコロシアイに走らせ、
#. そして、世界に絶望をもたらす…
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"They compel humans to kill each other, bringing\n"
"despair to the world."
msgstr ""

#. 私様は、それを<CLT 3>“絶望の種”<CLT>と呼ぶわ！
msgctxt "0041 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "This is what we refer to as <CLT 3>the seed of despair<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 絶望の種…？
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Seed of despair...?"
msgstr ""

#. 生物が、水や空気や食料で成長するように、
#. 絶望の種も<CLT 3>“あるもの”<CLT>によって成長を遂げる…
msgctxt "0043 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Just as water, air, and food promote growth in living\n"
"things, the seed of despair also needs <CLT 3>nourishment<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. そう、それは<CLT 3>希望<CLT>よ。
#. 希望があるからこそ絶望が育つの！
msgctxt "0044 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And that nourishment...is <CLT 3>hope<CLT>! Despair can grow\n"
"only in the presence of hope!"
msgstr ""

#. 表と裏、だけど紙一重…
#. それが希望と絶望なのよ！
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Two sides of the same coin, divided by a razor-thin\n"
"line... Such is hope and despair!"
msgstr ""

#. …いつまで、くだらない演説をしている。
msgctxt "0046 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...How much longer is this stupid speech of yours?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺達の記憶の話は、どうしたんだ？
#. 話をそらそうとしているのか？
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Weren't we discussing our missing memories? Why are\n"
"you trying to change the subject?"
msgstr ""

#. 話をそらすとは聞き捨てなりませんね…
#. 私は、あなた方の記憶について説明しているのですよ。
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you would listen, you would see I'm *not* changing\n"
"the subject. We *are* discussing your memories."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、その絶望の種は、
#. あなた方の記憶とも密接に関係しているのです。
msgctxt "0049 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"What I'm trying to say is, the \"seed of despair\" is\n"
"closely tied to your own memories."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どう関係してるって言うのよ…？
msgctxt "0050 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "H-How so...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は、あなた方から記憶を奪う事によって、
#. あなた方に希望を与えていたのです。
msgctxt "0051 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You see, by taking away your memories, I gave you\n"
"hope."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>絶望に食われる為の希望<CLT>…ですけどね。
msgctxt "0052 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Of course, that hope merely existed <CLT 3>to be consumed by\n"
"despair<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして記憶を奪うと…
#. 希望を与えた事になるの…？
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"How could taking away someone's memories...give them\n"
"hope?"
msgstr ""

#. つーか…そもそも希望なんて与えられてねーぞ…
msgctxt "0054 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And plus, you haven't given us any hope anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. …そうかしら？
#. あなた方は『ここから出たい』と思っていたでしょう？
msgctxt "0055 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Is that so? All you've been able to think about during\n"
"your time here is how to escape, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そう思う事こそが、
#. 希望を与えられている事に他ならないのですよ。
msgctxt "0056 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The mere fact that that's what you want proves I gave\n"
"you hope."
msgstr ""

#. 何を…言っている…？
msgctxt "0057 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What are you talking about...?"
msgstr ""

#. あなた達が<CLT 3>『ここから出たい』<CLT>と思わないと、
#. コロシアイも始まりません…
msgctxt "0058 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If none of you <CLT 3>wanted to escape this school<CLT>, the\n"
"killings never would have taken place."
msgstr ""

#. ですから、私様はあなた達の記憶を奪ったのです。
#. <CLT 3>『ここから出たい』<CLT>と思ってもらう為にね！
msgctxt "0059 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That is why we took your memories—so that you would\n"
"have <CLT 3>the desire to leave<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 記憶を奪われたからこそ、
#. 私達はここから出たいと思った…そういう意味？
msgctxt "0060 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The only reason we want to leave is because you took\n"
"our memories... Is that what you're saying?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…当たり…
msgctxt "0061 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... Correctamundo!"
msgstr ""

#. 逆に、記憶があったなら、
#. ここから出たいと思わなかったという事か？
msgctxt "0062 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Which means, if we *did* have our memories, then we\n"
"*wouldn't* want to leave. Do I understand that right?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだそりゃ…！
#. どうして記憶があると出たくなくなるんだって…！
msgctxt "0063 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Wh-What!? Why the HELL would having our memories make\n"
"us not wanna leave!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…困ってる、困ってる…
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... A most troubling thought, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、まだまだ足りないんだ。
#. もっと困って、もっと絶望してもらわないと…
msgctxt "0065 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"But it's not enough. I want more distress, more\n"
"despair...!"
msgstr ""

#. せっかく希望を糧にして、
#. ここまで大きく育った絶望なんだしさ…
msgctxt "0066 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I put so much effort into creating hope in order to\n"
"feed your despair and make it grow..."
msgstr ""

#. という訳で、自腹を切り刻むような大出血サービス！
#. ヒントを教えてあげましょうー！
msgctxt "0067 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So, just like Crazy Eddie slashing his prices and\n"
"passing the savings on to you, lemme give you a hint!"
msgstr ""

#. え！？　ホントにっ！？
msgctxt "0068 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? Really!?"
msgstr ""

#. さ、さっさと…お、教えなさいよッ！！
msgctxt "0069 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Then h-hurry up and tell us!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、百聞は一見にしかずって言うし…
msgctxt "0070 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Okey dokey! Like they say, seeing is believing!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラには<CLT 3>“外の世界”<CLT>をご覧頂こうかな。
msgctxt "0071 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'd like for you to see...<CLT 3>the outside world<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>外の…世界……？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The...outside world?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それって…この<CLT 3>学園の外<CLT>の事だよな？
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You mean <CLT 3>the world beyond the school walls<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、外で何か起きたのね？
msgctxt "0074 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So something really did happen out there..."
msgstr ""

#. …気になるよね？　やっぱり見たいよね？
msgctxt "0075 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Now are you interested in what I have to say? You\n"
"wanna see what's out there?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…ボクも見たいんだよね…
msgctxt "0076 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu. I wanna see, too..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラの絶望に沈んだ顔がさ…
msgctxt "0077 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "See your faces sink into despair...!"
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハッハ！
#. では、ご開帳でーーーっす！！
msgctxt "0078 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ah-hahahaha! Now then, OPEN SESAME!!!"
msgstr ""

#. これが外の世界だよ！　この学園の外の世界だよ！
msgctxt "0079 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Behold, the world beyond the school walls!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラが出たい出たいと騒いでいた、
#. 外の世界の全貌だよ！！
msgctxt "0080 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"This is the outside world you've all been so anxious\n"
"to claw your way back into!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………………………
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "... ... ..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………………………………………………………
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "... ... ... ... ..."
msgstr ""

#. ……は？
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What the...?"
msgstr ""

#. ヤバイ…世界がヤバイ…
#. そういう訳なんです…
msgctxt "0085 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Dangerous... The world has grown so very dangerous.\n"
"That's what this means."
msgstr ""

#. どういう訳だべ！？　さっぱりわからんぞ！
msgctxt "0086 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about!? None of this makes any\n"
"sense!"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これは…なんだ…！？
msgctxt "0087 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Wh-What am I looking at?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんかの映画とか…よね？
msgctxt "0088 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "This is a scene f-from a movie or something, r-right?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の映像が意味するもの…
#. あなた達は…それを知っているはずです…
msgctxt "0089 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What you just saw... All of you should recognize it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>知っている…って…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We should...recognize it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何を…知っているって言うんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What about it should we recognize?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あのふざけた映像の…何を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This whole thing is insane...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それは…あなた達の奪われた記憶の中にあるはずです…
msgctxt "0093 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That world...is locked away within the memories that\n"
"were taken from you."
msgstr ""

#. 思い出せないなら…思い出してください…
#. 頑張って思い出してください…
msgctxt "0094 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you can't remember, please just try... Do your best\n"
"to try and recall..."
msgstr ""

#. ひゃはは！　せいぜい自分の脳ミソを信じろ！
#. 死ぬも生きるもオメェの脳ミソ次第だ。
msgctxt "0095 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Haahahaha! Better kick your brain in the ass, cuz it's\n"
"up to that grey lump whether you live or die!"
msgstr ""

#. 思い出せねーなんて言い訳はなしだぞ！
#. だってよ、これって…
msgctxt "0096 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"\"I don't remember\" ain't a fuckin' excuse no more! Cuz\n"
"now it's time..."
msgstr ""

